<title>HUNGARY: CESI loses one and half percent, ends at 1,617.99.</title>
<headline>CESI loses one and half percent, ends at 1,617.99.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index continued to fall on Wednesday to close at 1,617.99 points, down 24.40 points or 1.49 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page  .CESI.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
